{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05667","headline":"故右丞相赠太师燕文贞公挽词二首 二 · 孙逖","name":"故右丞相赠太师燕文贞公挽词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甲第三重戟，高门四列侯。\n已成冠盖里，更有凤皇楼。\n人世方爲乐，生涯遽若休。\n空余掌纶地，传庆百千秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙逖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05667.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05667","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}